nventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITAJIMA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NABESHIMA, AKIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOMOTAKI, YOSHIHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Curing agents for epoxy resins which contain as the active ingredient at least one member selected from among compounds represented by general formula (I) and salts thereof: wherein X is -(CH2)n- or -(CH2)l-Y-(CH2)m-; Y is -N(R&lt;1&gt;)-, -O- or -S-; R&lt;1&gt; is C1-C8 alkyl or amino; n is a number of 2, 3, or 5 to 11; and l and m are each a number of 1 to 8.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur des agents de durcissement pour résines époxy qui contiennent comme ingrédient actif au moins un élément sélectionné parmi des composés représentés par la formule générale (I), ainsi que sur les sels de ces agents. Dans cette formule, X est -(CH2)n- ou -(CH2)1-Y-(CH2)m; Y est -N(R&lt;1&gt;)-, -O- ou -S-; R&lt;1&gt; est un alkyle C1-C8 ou un amino; n vaut 2, 3 ou 5 ou est compris entre 5 et 11; et 1 et m représentent chacun un nombre compris entre 1 et 8.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>